{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>曾獲 Apple 於美國及加拿大 App Store 推薦的 Exif Viewer by Fluntro，是一款專為專業攝影師與 iPhone 使用者而設的 EXIF 元數據檢視、管理及編輯工具，介面簡潔、操作流暢，並能在 iPhone、iPad 與 iPod Touch 上帶來一致的使用體驗。App 原價 US $2.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>檢視與編輯照片元數據</h2>\n<p>App 可刪除相片內的 EXIF 與 GPS 資料以保障私隱，亦能檢視 ISO、快門、焦距、相機型號、鏡頭型號、時間戳及光圈等詳細資訊。它支援高達 80 MB 的高清晰度圖像、滑動切換、地圖檢視、批量編輯與自訂標籤，並可選擇分享時保留或移除 EXIF 資料。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1125x2436bb-19.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1125x2436bb-20.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1125x2436bb-21.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1125x2436bb-22.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1125x2436bb-23.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1125x2436bb-24.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Exif Viewer by Fluntro</li>\n<li>應用類別：Photo &amp; Video</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-10T11:58:38.366640+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":375,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}